I soared around!

155
00:42:07,538 --> 00:42:12,538
みんなの青春 今日ここで 今 ねねにいっぱいに見せてください！
Show Nene all of your youth, right here, right now!

156
00:42:13,238 --> 00:42:18,338
大人になればなるほど 僕ら 心が動くことも減るのかな
The more we grow up, I wonder if our hearts are moved less often.

157
00:42:18,538 --> 00:42:22,838
後戻りなんて出来やしないから
Since there's no turning back,

158
00:42:22,938 --> 00:42:27,038
まっすぐ僕のドキドキに
straight toward my fluttering heart!

159
00:42:27,138 --> 00:42:31,338
いつだって躍らされて汗をかいてちゃうような
Constantly dancing to the beat and working up a sweat,

160
00:42:31,438 --> 00:42:36,338
そんな毎日にね ずっとひそかに宝のまんまでいた
in every single day like that, it quietly remained a treasure.

161
00:42:36,538 --> 00:42:39,538
すぐの芽は まだ止まらない
The sprouting buds won't stop growing yet!

162
00:42:39,638 --> 00:42:42,938
タンタンタン！ いくつだってくらい パンパンパン！ 弾けちゃえ
Tap-tap-tap! As many times as you like, clap-clap-clap! Burst right out!

163
00:42:43,038 --> 00:42:49,038
カタカタ 重なる声 モヤモヤも全部飲み干して
Clattering overlapping voices, gulp down all the gloom and haze!

164
00:42:49,138 --> 00:42:53,238
タンタンタン！ 君のまま 描いていて
Tap-tap-tap! Keep painting as your true self!

165
00:42:53,438 --> 00:42:58,138
パッと夜に咲く 一輪の花
A single flower bursting into bloom in the night,

166
00:42:58,238 --> 00:43:03,338
のように 僕ら 確かにここに足跡を残す
just like that, we surely leave our footprints right here.

167
00:43:03,438 --> 00:43:07,338
打ち鳴らせ 満開の
Sound it loud! In full bloom,

168
00:43:07,438 --> 00:43:11,338
あてはまる 言葉が 花束を追い越すの
the fitting words overtake the bouquet!

169
00:43:11,438 --> 00:43:16,538
きっと それくらいでいいの 今更にもう手繰り寄せて
Surely that's just fine; reeling it all in even now,

170
00:43:16,738 --> 00:43:19,938
さあ行こう！
Let's go!

171
00:43:41,338 --> 00:43:44,738
というわけで 始まりましたー！
And with that, it has officially begun!

172
00:43:44,738 --> 00:43:52,538
桃鈴ねね 1st Live『花咲くねねねねねねねね超開花』！
Momosuzu Nene 1st Live, "Hanasaku Nenenenenenene Choukaika"!

173
00:43:58,738 --> 00:44:02,538
じゃあまず ねねの自己紹介をさせていただきたいと思います！
First off, I'd like to do Nene's self-introduction!

174
00:44:02,538 --> 00:44:06,538
ねねが「みんなの心の？」って言ったら みんな何て返すんだっけ？
When Nene says, "Who's in everyone's hearts?", how do you reply?

175
00:44:07,938 --> 00:44:10,038
その通り！ よくできました！
Exactly! Well done!

176
00:44:10,038 --> 00:44:14,838
じゃあいくよー！ ホロライブ・ねぽらぼの「ね」！ みんなの心の？
Here we go! The "Ne" in Hololive's NePoLaBo! Who's in everyone's hearts?

177
00:44:17,038 --> 00:44:21,038
桃鈴ねねでーす！
It's Momosuzu Nene!

178
00:44:24,538 --> 00:44:29,038
もう待ちに待ちに待ちに待った 1st Live！
The 1st Live we've all been waiting and waiting and waiting for!

179
00:44:29,338 --> 00:44:33,538
今回のテーマは「楽しさ最大出力」をテーマに
With this show's theme being "Maximum Joy Output,"

180
00:44:33,538 --> 00:44:38,738
ねねがみんなと一緒に超開花していくっていうライブにしていきたいと思っています！
I want to make this a live show where Nene reaches super bloom together with all of you!

181
00:44:41,738 --> 00:44:47,038
いいねいいね！ 普通のライブと違って みんなが参加してめちゃくちゃ楽しめるようにね
Nice, nice! Unlike a regular live show, so that everyone can join in and have a blast,

182
00:44:47,038 --> 00:44:52,538
いっぱいワクワクとかドキドキを持ってきたから みんな楽しみにしててねー！
I brought lots of excitement and thrills, so please look forward to it!

183
00:44:55,038 --> 00:44:59,538
そして ねねの1stアルバム『Pieceful Story』 みんな聴いてくれた？
And did everyone listen to Nene's 1st album, "Pieceful Story"?

184
00:45:03,313 --> 00:45:06,513
いいね！もうなんかタオルがちょっと汗ばんできてる人がいるくない？
Nice! Aren't there already some people whose towels are getting a bit sweaty?

185
00:45:07,513 --> 00:45:09,213
みんなはどの曲が好きだった？
Which song did everyone like?

186
00:45:09,213 --> 00:45:10,513
せーの！
Ready, go!

187
00:45:13,013 --> 00:45:15,013
おー、おー、おー...
Ooh, ooh, ooh...

188
00:45:15,013 --> 00:45:18,013
ちょっと待って、そ、そっちの人、な、何、何が好き？
Wait a sec, people over there, wh-what did you like?

189
00:45:18,813 --> 00:45:20,313
全部？全部？
All of them? All of them?

190
00:45:20,513 --> 00:45:22,513
こっ、こっちの人は？
Wh-what about the people over here?

191
00:45:23,313 --> 00:45:24,513
全部！全部か！
All of them! All of them, huh!

192
00:45:24,513 --> 00:45:27,513
ねねも全部好きでーす！
Nene loves all of them too!

193
00:45:28,813 --> 00:45:30,213
ありがとう！そして今回は、
Thank you! And this time...

194
00:45:30,213 --> 00:45:34,213
ガールズバンドの生演奏でお届けしていきまーす！
We're bringing it to you with live music from an all-girls band!

195
00:45:34,213 --> 00:45:36,513
ご紹介をさせてくださーい！
Please let me introduce them!

196
00:45:36,813 --> 00:45:40,813
キーボードで、バンドマスターの、しえりーほさん！
On keyboards and Band Master, Shieriho-san!

197
00:45:45,013 --> 00:45:49,513
そして、ギターの、にいづまりおんさん！
And on guitar, Niizuma Rion-san!

198
00:45:51,013 --> 00:45:52,213
かっこいい！
So cool!

199
00:45:52,213 --> 00:45:56,313
そして、ベースの、あいみべーダーさん！
And on bass, Aimi Vader-san!

200
00:45:57,013 --> 00:45:58,713
渋くていいね！
Love that cool vibe!

201
00:45:58,713 --> 00:46:02,513
ドラムの、ばんだななこさんでーす！
On drums, it's Banda Nanako-san!

202
00:46:05,813 --> 00:46:09,613
はい！そしてちょっとね、配信のほうにも触れていきたいと思うんですけど、
Alright! And I'd like to check in with the stream viewers too,

203
00:46:09,613 --> 00:46:12,513
みんなコメントいっぱいありがとーー！
but thank you so much for all the comments!

204
00:46:13,813 --> 00:46:17,513
このへんにね、あの配信の人が見てるカメラがあるの。
Right around here is the camera that the stream viewers are seeing.

205
00:46:18,013 --> 00:46:20,513
いぇーーーい！
Yaaay!

206
00:46:21,013 --> 00:46:24,013
みんなありがと！いっぱいスクショ撮ってねー！
Thank you, everyone! Take lots of screenshots!

207
00:46:24,513 --> 00:46:28,313
そして今回のライブの感想とかはね、
And for your impressions of today's live concert,

208
00:46:28,313 --> 00:46:31,513
全部ハッシュタグ、ももす... あ、違うな、違うな、違うな...
use the hashtag #Momo... ah wait, no, no, no...

209
00:46:31,713 --> 00:46:37,013
ハッシュタグ #ねね超開花 でたくさんポストしてくださーい！
Please post a lot with the hashtag #NeneChouKaika!

210
00:46:39,213 --> 00:46:45,013
そして、今YouTube、そしてTikTokでご覧の方は、次の曲まで聴けるので、
And for those watching on YouTube and TikTok right now, you can listen up until the next song,

211
00:46:45,513 --> 00:46:49,513
まだまだ一緒に盛り上がりたいなーって人は、
so if you want to keep getting hyped up together,

212
00:46:49,513 --> 00:46:54,513
概要欄から配信サイトへGOしてください！
please GO to the streaming site from the description box!

213
00:46:56,513 --> 00:47:00,813
さあみんな！始まる前からギラファねね合唱してたけど、
Alright everyone! You were chanting "Giraffa Nene" even before we started,

214
00:47:00,813 --> 00:47:04,013
まだまだライブ始まってたった2曲だからね！
but the concert's just begun—we've only done two songs!

215
00:47:04,013 --> 00:47:07,513
さっそく次の曲行こうかなー！
Let's get right into the next song!

216
00:47:08,513 --> 00:47:12,513
次は少ししっとりめの曲かな。聴いてください。
The next one is a more mellow song. Please listen.

217
00:47:40,813 --> 00:47:44,213
覚えているかな
Do you remember?

218
00:47:44,213 --> 00:47:48,313
桜色に染まった
It was dyed in the color of cherry blossoms.

219
00:47:48,813 --> 00:47:52,813
帰り道の途中
On the way back home,

220
00:47:52,813 --> 00:47:57,013
流れてく春の吹雪
a spring blizzard of petals drifts by.

221
00:47:57,013 --> 00:48:01,013
隣を歩いて
Walking beside you,

222
00:48:01,013 --> 00:48:05,013
少し背伸びしていた
I tried to stand a little taller.

223
00:48:05,013 --> 00:48:08,813
変わらない距離を
This unchanged distance between us,

224
00:48:08,813 --> 00:48:12,613
本当は縮めたくて
I truly wanted to close.

225
00:48:12,613 --> 00:48:16,613
消えなくて
It wouldn't disappear,

226
00:48:16,613 --> 00:48:20,613
言えなくて
and I couldn't say it.

227
00:48:20,613 --> 00:48:25,013
「またね」じゃ足りないよ
"See you later" isn't enough.

228
00:48:25,013 --> 00:48:29,013
いつかまた会えるかな
I wonder if we'll meet again someday.

229
00:48:29,013 --> 00:48:33,013
君と何回だって 何回だって
No matter how many times, with you,

230
00:48:33,013 --> 00:48:37,513
笑い合えた春の日
on those spring days we laughed together.

231
00:48:37,513 --> 00:48:41,813
風に舞って ふわり消えた
Dancing in the wind, it softly faded away.

232
00:48:41,813 --> 00:48:45,513
それでも忘れない
Even so, I will never forget.

233
00:48:45,513 --> 00:48:50,313
この季節が巡って 離れてく
As this season comes around and drifts away,

234
00:48:50,313 --> 00:48:54,213
言葉を探していた
I was searching for the words.

235
00:48:54,213 --> 00:48:58,213
淡く揺れて 溶けた思い
Feelings faintly swaying and melting away,

236
00:48:58,213 --> 00:49:02,013
それでも忘れない
even so, I will never forget.

237
00:49:02,013 --> 00:49:05,813
「さよなら」じゃなくて
Not a "goodbye,"

238
00:49:05,813 --> 00:49:09,013
ありがとう
but "thank you."

239
00:49:15,013 --> 00:49:18,513
言葉もなくて
Without any words,

240
00:49:18,513 --> 00:49:22,513
胸の奥にしまった
I locked it away deep in my heart.

241
00:49:22,513 --> 00:49:26,513
あどけない気持ち
These innocent feelings,

242
00:49:26,513 --> 00:49:30,213
ホントは伝えたくて
I truly wanted to tell you.

243
00:49:30,213 --> 00:49:34,013
届けたい
I want to reach you,

244
00:49:34,013 --> 00:49:38,013
届かない
but I can't.

245
00:49:38,013 --> 00:49:42,513
「またね」じゃ足りないけど
"See you later" isn't enough, but

246
00:49:42,513 --> 00:49:46,513
いつかまた会えるかな
I wonder if we'll meet again someday.

247
00:49:46,513 --> 00:49:50,813
君と何回だって 何回だって
No matter how many times, with you,

248
00:49:50,813 --> 00:49:56,013
見上げた空の色も
even the color of the sky we gazed up at.

249
00:49:56,013 --> 00:50:00,013
風に乗って ひらり飛んだ花びら
Riding the wind, the fluttering petals flew away.

250
00:50:01,121 --> 00:50:03,221
桃色の
The peach-colored...

251
00:50:03,221 --> 00:50:09,621
これから描く未来地図
The map of the future we're about to draw,

252
00:50:09,621 --> 00:50:12,921
魔法みたいに染めて
is dyed just like magic.

253
00:50:12,921 --> 00:50:20,521
きっとどこにも行かない明日だとしても
Even if tomorrow leads to nowhere...

254
00:50:20,521 --> 00:50:24,821
今も今も褪せない記憶
Even now, memories that never fade,

255
00:50:24,821 --> 00:50:28,921
写真みたいに色づいて
are colored just like a photograph.

256
00:50:28,921 --> 00:50:37,621
ずっとずっと想い出たち 春の色がした
All of those memories had the color of spring.

257
00:50:37,621 --> 00:50:42,921
君と「仲良くだって、仲良くだって」
With you, saying, "We're good friends, we're good friends,"

258
00:50:42,921 --> 00:50:47,521
笑い合えた春の日
on that spring day we laughed together.

259
00:50:47,521 --> 00:50:51,121
風に舞って ふわり消えた
Dancing in the wind, it softly disappeared.

260
00:50:51,121 --> 00:50:55,321
それでも忘れない
Even so, I won't forget.

261
00:50:55,321 --> 00:51:00,321
届きかけた手 ほどかれてく
My reaching hand gently slips away,

262
00:51:00,321 --> 00:51:04,421
言葉を探していた
as I searched for words.

263
00:51:04,421 --> 00:51:08,221
淡く触れて溶けた想い
Feelings that faintly touched and melted away—

264
00:51:08,221 --> 00:51:11,621
それでも忘れない
even so, I won't forget.

265
00:51:11,621 --> 00:51:19,621
さよならじゃなくて ありがとう
Not a "goodbye," but a "thank you."

266
00:51:31,621 --> 00:51:37,121
生まれたてのドキドキを 響かせてみよう
Let's make this brand-new excitement resound!

267
00:51:37,121 --> 00:51:39,321
最高の時間 最高の...
The best time, the best...

